#3502
The Laneway~
   The laneway, where the roads of the east meet. East, the broad King's
Road sets off straight as a spear toward King Welmar's castle; west, the
lane runs on toward the shrine where the Supply Road turns for Midgaard. A
steep path drops away down to the northeast toward the dwarven village, and
a lane goes north between the trees. Wheel-ruts from the levy carts are cut
deep into every road.
